   143	    - Below the separator are 2-4 red anchor pixels on black background, with enough room to center the repaired motif on each anchor.
   144	
   145	    Rule:
   146	    - Infer the vertical and horizontal symmetry axes from the visible non-black pixels in the upper pattern.
   147	    - Fill erased black cells from their mirrored counterparts, using the two-axis mirror as the tie-breaker when vertical and horizontal mirrors disagree.
